          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Spikes in global energy prices tied to Iran–Gulf conflict increase market perceptions that oil production or transport is vulnerable to further shocks, raising the assessed probability and severity of supply disruptions relevant to the Russia–Ukraine energy context." />
