          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sharp Iran-Gulf driven rise in oil and gas prices triggers immediate investor reweighting from rate-sensitive/high-growth assets (notably China tech) into energy producers, commodities and safe‑haven assets, accelerating observed portfolio reallocation flows between regions and asset classes." />
