          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in geopolitical_tension (incidents, accusations, or escalation risk) causes governments to rapidly expand export controls, foreign‑investment reviews and interagency vetting of cross‑border AI collaborations, directly increasing regulatory and legislative scrutiny intensity." />
          <attvalue for="37" value="0-6 months" />
