          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Acute rises in US–China tech friction (incidents, sanctions, or covert operations) prompt executive-branch requests for emergency authorities and congressional delegations of national-security decision-making, shifting de facto policymaking power toward the executive." />
