          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained large-scale capital flows out of contested-tech sectors or into safe-haven assets reduce liquidity and push down forward returns in higher-risk segments, which mechanically lowers investors' willingness to maintain elevated risk exposures." />
